==English==

===Alternative forms===
* [[exclame]] {{defdate|16th-17th c.}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|frm|en}} {{term|exclamer|lang=frm}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|exclāmāre||call out}}, from {{term|ex-}} + {{term|clamare|clāmāre|to call}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/ɛkˈskleɪm/|/ɪkˈskleɪm/}}
* {{rhymes|eɪm}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{context|intransitive|lang=en}} To [[cry out]] suddenly, from some strong emotion.

====Synonyms====
* See also [[Wikisaurus:shout]]

